/-! ## (1) THE BUNDLE — the full dimensionful skeleton welded, one load-bearing fact per row. -/

/-- ★★★ THE M1–M7 BUNDLE: one derived object welding the ONE unit peg + uniqueness (M1), the certified
    dimensionful numerals (M2–M6), and the closed cross-check web (M7). Each conjunct is a banked
    theorem; the conjunction is statable from no single conjunct alone (seven independent rows). -/
theorem massSkeleton_bundle :
    -- (M1) the one-peg uniqueness
    (∀ p q : UnitPeg, ∃ c : Cut, 0 < c ∧ ∀ x, q.human x = c * p.human x)
    -- (M2) the lepton numeral + N340 consistency
    ∧ ((50535 / (10 : Cut) ^ 17 ≤ absMass0 ∧ absMass0 ≤ 50565 / (10 : Cut) ^ 17)
        ∧ (absMass1 / absMass0 = mass1 / mass0 ∧ absMass2 / absMass0 = mass2 / mass0))
    -- (M3) the confinement numeral + the band free
    ∧ (((4347 : Cut) ≤ confBandRatio ∧ confBandRatio ≤ 4350)
        ∧ bandScreen chargeTraceDepth confBandRatio = 128 / 27)
    -- (M4) the scale-tower numeral + the one-ladder tooth
    ∧ (((54220 * (10 : Cut) ^ 8 ≤ topBandRatio ∧ topBandRatio ≤ 54226 * (10 : Cut) ^ 8))
        ∧ topBandRatio * confBandRatio = confinementScaleRatio⁻¹)
